        "id": "p22-q30-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Find all values of $x$ in the domain $[-4,5]$ that satisfy $f(g(x))=3$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=-1,\\ 5$.",
          "worked": "On the graph of $f$, the output is $3$ only when its input is $0$. Therefore $g(x)=0$. The graph of $g$ crosses the $x$-axis at $x=-1$ and $x=5$, so the solutions are $x=-1,\\ 5$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 23
      },
      {
        "id": "p22-q30-b",
        "type": "group",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": {
          "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
          "version": 1,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "p22-q30-b-heading",
              "type": "paragraph",
